timeline
    title Dated milestones in the convergence on ISO 20022 data
    section Regulation and national files
        2015 : PSD2 adopted as Directive (EU) 2015/2366
        Feb 2018 : Febelfin CODA 2.6 dated (2.7 is current)
    section Market infrastructures
        Mar 2023 : T2 (Eurosystem) migrates
        Jun 2023 : CHAPS migrates
        14 Jul 2025 : Fedwire Funds single-day cutover
    section Swift cross-border and EU payments
        9 Oct 2025 : Verification of Payee mandatory for euro credit transfers
        22 Nov 2025 : MT/MX coexistence ends for cross-border payment instructions
    section What comes next
        27 Nov 2025 : PSD3 and PSR provisional agreement
        Aug 2026 : Swift accepts request to extend structured address migration
        14 Nov 2026 : Original CBPR+ unstructured address cut-off (deferred)
        12 Jun 2027 : Deferred SR 2026 release
